	'index.pixels.header' => 'Advanced Analytics & Performance Tracking',
	'index.pixels.subheader' => 'All smart links and the Forever Card Application integrate with leading analytics and advertising platforms.',
	'index.pixels.note' => 'Tracking data allows partners to understand what works: which content drives interest, where visitors come from, and which campaigns generate results. The system supports integration with major pixel and tracking providers.',
	'index.pricing.header' => 'Simple, transparent pricing.',
	'index.testimonials.header' => 'Why people love us',
	'index.testimonials.one.text' => 'This platform completely transformed the way we manage our workflows. It’s intuitive, fast, and has saved our team countless hours every week.',
	'index.testimonials.one.name' => 'Andrea Wilson',
	'index.testimonials.one.attribute' => 'Editor, Writer\'s Weekly',
	'index.testimonials.two.text' => 'I was skeptical at first, but within days, I saw how much more productive our team became. The support team is also incredibly responsive.',
	'index.testimonials.two.name' => 'George Parker',
	'index.testimonials.two.attribute' => 'Founder, BrightPath Solutions',
	'index.testimonials.three.text' => 'We’ve tried multiple tools before, but nothing comes close to this. The onboarding was smooth, and our entire team was up and running in no time.',
	'index.testimonials.three.name' => 'Calvin Mitchell',
	'index.testimonials.three.attribute' => 'CEO, FlowWorks Inc.',
	'index.partners.header' => 'Why partners use Forever Card Club',
	'index.partners.subheader' => 'A structured digital system for professional and global Forever business building.',
	'index.partners.card1.title' => 'One system – everything in one place',
	'index.partners.card1.text' => 'Personal app, smart links, education, AI support and analytics combined into a single digital ecosystem.',
	'index.partners.card2.title' => 'Global routing without complexity',
	'index.partners.card2.text' => 'Smart links automatically detect the visitor’s country and connect them to the official Forever web shop in their region.',
	'index.partners.card3.title' => 'Professional online & offline presence',
	'index.partners.card3.text' => 'Personal app and NFC card allow easy sharing without technical knowledge.',
	'index.partners.card4.title' => 'Clear growth structure',
	'index.partners.card4.text' => 'A structured 120-day plan and step-by-step education help partners build a stable and scalable system.',
	'index.faq.header' => 'Answers to common questions',
	'index.faq.one.question' => 'How do I get my Forever Card App?',
	'index.faq.one.answer' => 'You receive your Forever Card App when you become a registered Forever business partner and your sponsor is within our team. After access is granted, you follow a simple onboarding process that shows you how to activate and set up your personal app. Your app is your digital base: you choose which blocks to display (for example video, products, AI advisor, contact, education) and you can set everything up without technical skills. If you also work offline, you receive a free NFC card delivered to your address, which opens your app with a quick tap/scan.',
	'index.faq.two.question' => 'How do the global discount and referral work?',
	'index.faq.two.answer' => 'Forever Card Club uses smart referral links designed for global sharing. When a visitor clicks your link or selects a product inside your app and chooses "order", the system can automatically detect the visitor’s country and connect them to the official Forever web shop in their country. Your referral is built into the link so the purchase can be associated with you as the recommending partner, in line with the official system rules. Important: Forever Card Club does not sell products. All purchases are completed through the official web shop in the customer’s country.',
	'index.faq.three.question' => 'What do I receive as a team member?',
	'index.faq.three.answer' => 'As a team member, you receive a complete system for building a Forever business online, including: a personal Forever Card App (your tools and content in one place), smart referral links for global routing to the official web shop, an AI advisor for product guidance and information inside the app, step-by-step education (how to use the system and build online), a personalized 120-day plan aligned with your habits and goals, analytics (what people click, where they come from, what works best), a free NFC card delivered to your address for offline contacts. You also get community support (for example WhatsApp groups and clear guidelines) to help you stay consistent and build long-term results.',
	'index.faq.four.question' => 'How does the 120-day plan work?',
	'index.faq.four.answer' => 'The 120-day plan is a structured program that guides partners from initial setup, through habit building, into a consistent routine of online communication, recommendations, and team/customer growth. It is not a generic PDF. It is designed to adapt to the person: your available time, communication style, experience level, and goals. The plan provides clear steps on what to set up in your app, how to use smart links, how to present information online, and how to build a repeatable system that can be duplicated with your future team.',
	'index.faq.five.question' => 'What does the AI advisor do inside the app?',
	'index.faq.five.answer' => 'The AI advisor helps visitors navigate information more easily. Based on their questions, it can suggest relevant information and products, then guide them to the next step (learn more, contact, or order). If the visitor chooses to order, the AI advisor can direct them to the official web shop using smart links, with the partner’s referral connection. For partners, it reduces the need to repeat basic information and helps keep communication clear and consistent.',
	'index.faq.contact_note' => 'If you want access or have a question, reach out via the %s.',
	'index.faq.contact_link' => 'Contact page',
