	'global.emails.admin.card_sent_email.subject' => 'Your new card has been created and sent to your address.',
	'global.emails.admin.card_sent_email.body' => 'Hello {{NAME}}, <br /><br />
        Welcome to the <strong>Forever Card Club</strong>! 🎉<br /><br />

        We have some great news — your <strong>Forever Card</strong> NFC card has just been created and will soon be shipped to your address. <br /><br />

        👉 Here is your <strong>digital link</strong> encoded on your card.  
        You can edit and use it anytime: <br /><br />

        <strong style="font-size:16px; color:#00834a;">{{LINK}}</strong><br /><br />

        <hr style="margin:30px 0; border:none; border-top:1px solid #ccc;" />

        <h3 style="color:#222;">First Steps for a Successful Start</h3>

        <p><strong>Get to know Forever products:</strong><br />
        Start by using the products you received when joining (2 cc).  
        Your personal experience will help you confidently recommend them to others.</p>

        <p><strong>Watch the key educational videos:</strong><br />
        • <a href="https://forevercard.club/blog/forever-living-products" target="_blank">Forever Living Products</a> – learn about the company and its philosophy.<br />
        • <a href="https://forevercard.club/blog/forever-living-business" target="_blank">Forever Living Business</a> – understand how the business model and marketing plan work.<br />
        • <a href="https://forevercard.club/blog/pristup-sluzbenim-stranicama-kompanije" target="_blank">Access to official FLP websites</a> – learn how to track points, your team, and customers.<br />
        • <a href="https://forevercard.club/blog/raspodjela-novca-u-forever-livingu" target="_blank">Forever Compensation Plan</a> – understand how earnings and career positions work.<br />
        • <a href="https://forevercard.club/blog/4cc-aktivnost" target="_blank">4CC Activity</a> – the key requirement for bonuses and commission payments.</p>

        <p><strong>Explore Forever Card Club digital tools:</strong><br />
